From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angel Pons <th3fanbus@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 14:54:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Haswell NRI: Add library to measure margins/BER

This will be used in subsequent commits. These functions are quite
similar and could potentially be unified but they have differences
which would need to be taken into account somehow.

Also, refactor the handling of `last_margin` a bit to simplify the
new code populating the array, which works with indices.

Only RMT (Rank Margin Tool) enables BER (Bit Error Rate) measuring
and interpolation. The other tests only care about margins.

Change-Id: Ia68659344840bb05a068862ebb34a2c78c0fa880
Signed-off-by: Angel Pons <th3fanbus@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 131ed83f301ea24321eb912000d2ae0d2685798a)
